---
import '@fontsource-variable/fraunces';
import '@fontsource-variable/inter';
import '@fontsource/courier-prime/400.css';
import '../styles/global.css';
const flowers = [
  { x: 150, y: 172, r: -16, color: '#bb6172' },
  { x: 216, y: 114, r: 10, color: '#da9b8b' },
  { x: 292, y: 151, r: -8, color: '#a95169' },
  { x: 365, y: 106, r: 18, color: '#cf887b' },
  { x: 430, y: 182, r: -12, color: '#bf728c' },
];
---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="robots" content="noindex" />
    <meta name="description" content="A little something for Savindi, with love from Akil." />
    <meta name="theme-color" content="#f8f2e9" />
    <title>Happy one month, Savindi ♡</title>
  </head>
  <body class="anniversary">
    <a class="skip-link" href="#letter">Skip to the letter</a>
    <main>
      <header class="dedication"><span>A little something for Savindi</span><span aria-hidden="true">A + S</span></header>
      <section class="opening" aria-labelledby="anniversary-title">
        <p class="occasion">Our first month</p>
        <h1 id="anniversary-title">Happy one month,<br /><em>Savindi.</em></h1>
        <p class="opening-note">I wanted to make you something.<br />So I made a little place here, for you.</p>
        <div class="bouquet" aria-hidden="true">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 600 440" fill="none">
            <defs><pattern id="stitches" width="12" height="12" patternUnits="userSpaceOnUse"><path d="M2 2 4 4M8 8l2 2" stroke="#ba9e8b" opacity=".12" /></pattern></defs>
            <path d="M92 320V201a208 208 0 0 1 416 0v119" stroke="#d7bfb0" stroke-dasharray="2 7" />
            <path d="M105 325V205a195 195 0 0 1 390 0v120Z" fill="url(#stitches)" />
            {flowers.map((f,i)=><g class="flower" style={`--delay:${i*100}ms;--turn:${f.r}deg;transform-origin:${f.x}px ${f.y}px`}>
              <path d={`M300 367Q${f.x+35} 260 ${f.x} ${f.y}`} stroke="#657b5d" stroke-width="2" />
              <path d={`M${f.x+40} ${f.y+100}q-44-4-40-34 35 0 40 34Z`} fill="#94a48a" />
              <path d={`M${f.x+52} ${f.y+133}q39-8 33-36-30 4-33 36Z`} fill="#718969" />
              <g class="blossom" style={`transform-origin:${f.x}px ${f.y}px`} fill={f.color}>
                {[0,60,120,180,240,300].map(angle=><ellipse cx={f.x} cy={f.y-17} rx="13" ry="22" transform={`rotate(${angle} ${f.x} ${f.y})`} />)}
                <circle cx={f.x} cy={f.y} r="10" fill="#e9c79a" /><circle cx={f.x-2} cy={f.y-2} r="3" fill="#96704e" opacity=".5" />
              </g>
            </g>)}
            <g class="ribbon"><path d="M299 350c-73-56-88 16-8 12-45 10-39 29-56 44M301 350c68-61 89 11 7 12 45 10 43 30 56 41" stroke="#b56b78" stroke-width="6" stroke-linecap="round"/><path d="M287 352q12-7 25 0v16h-25Z" fill="#a95c6b" /></g>
          </svg>
        </div>
        <span class="tiny-heart" aria-hidden="true">♡</span>
      </section>
      <section class="letter-section" id="letter" aria-label="A letter for Savindi">
        <details class="letter">
          <summary><span class="envelope-art" aria-hidden="true"><span class="envelope-flap"></span><span class="seal">♡</span></span><span class="letter-label">For you, with love <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span></summary>
          <div class="letter-paper">
            <p class="salutation">My Savi,</p>
            <p>Happy one month, Savi.</p>
            <p>I really didn’t expect things to go this way when I was looking for matches on Tinder. But a few months after we matched, and one month into officially being together, you’ve made me feel so much love and affection. It honestly feels like someone answered prayers and wishes I never even made in the first place. Lucky me.</p>
            <p>I had such a nice time with you in Hiriketiya. We ate so much pizza and it was so good. And I still think about how hyped you were to get into the ocean, and then how you got scared of the waves and ran back, almost falling over when one hit you. You’re so cute. There’s no one else I would rather have gone on that trip with.</p>
            <p>And on the bus back to Colombo, when you had your head on my shoulder, I felt so content. I don’t really know how else to put it. That’s such a rare feeling to have with someone. I’m so glad I get to have it with you.</p>
            <p>Even before that trip, I loved going to the museum with you, and to the planetarium on another day. I just loved getting to share those experiences with you. Your company and just talking with you feel so amazing. I feel so lucky that I get to feel that way about someone, and that it’s you.</p>
            <p>Another thing I can still picture so clearly is us sitting next to each other in my room, with your legs on my lap, watching a movie and eating Dinemore submarines. You looked so cute in my T-shirt. I can still vividly picture you sitting there.</p>
            <p>I love how you’ve so effortlessly made your way into my heart, and my space, and the things I do. It all feels so natural. Being your boyfriend feels so easy. I feel like I can just be myself with you and really connect with you, and that means so much to me.</p>
            <p>I love you, Savi. I’m really happy it’s you.</p>
            <p class="signature">Yours,<br /><span>Akil</span><span class="signature-heart" aria-hidden="true">♡</span></p>
            <p class="postscript">P.S. I also really like your cute butt.</p>
          </div>
        </details>
      </section>
      <section class="keepsakes" aria-label="A few little memories">
        <div class="section-kicker"><span></span><p>A few little memories</p><span></span></div>
        <div class="notes">
          <details class="little-note"><summary><span aria-hidden="true">≈</span>Hiriketiya</summary><p>I had such a nice time on that trip with you. We had so much pizza and it was delicious.</p><p>You were so hyped to get into the ocean, but then you got scared of the waves and ran back. And when that wave hit you, you almost fell over. I still smile thinking about it.</p><p>Then on the bus back to Colombo, you had your head on my shoulder and I felt so content. That’s such a rare feeling to have with someone. There’s no one else I would rather have gone there with.</p></details>
          <details class="little-note"><summary><span aria-hidden="true">✧</span>The museum &amp; planetarium</summary><p>We went on different days, but I feel the same way about both. I loved sharing those experiences with you.</p><p>Just being with you and talking with you feels so amazing. I’m so lucky I get to feel that way with someone, the way I do with you.</p></details>
          <details class="little-note"><summary><span aria-hidden="true">⌂</span>In my room</summary><p>We were sitting next to each other, your legs on my lap, watching a movie and eating Dinemore submarines. You looked so cute in my T-shirt. I can still picture it so clearly.</p><p>I love how naturally you’ve become part of my space and the things I do. I can just be myself with you. It feels so easy to be close to you.</p></details>
        </div>
      </section>
      <footer><p>One month with you.</p><span>And I’m looking forward to the next.</span><div aria-hidden="true">A <i>♡</i> S</div></footer>
    </main>
    <script>
      const reduced = matchMedia('(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)');
      const bouquet = document.querySelector<HTMLElement>('.bouquet');
      bouquet?.addEventListener('pointermove', event => {
        if (reduced.matches || event.pointerType !== 'mouse') return;
        const rect = bouquet.getBoundingClientRect();
        bouquet.style.setProperty('--sway', `${((event.clientX - rect.left) / rect.width - .5) * 5}deg`);
      });
      bouquet?.addEventListener('pointerleave', () => bouquet.style.setProperty('--sway', '0deg'));
      reduced.addEventListener('change', () => bouquet?.style.setProperty('--sway', '0deg'));
      const letter = document.querySelector<HTMLDetailsElement>('.letter');
      letter?.addEventListener('toggle', () => {
        if (!letter.open || reduced.matches) return;
        letter.querySelector('.letter-paper')?.animate([{ opacity: 0, transform: 'translateY(12px)' }, { opacity: 1, transform: 'translateY(0)' }], { duration: 500, easing: 'ease-out' });
      });
    </script>
  </body>
</html>
<style>
:global(body.anniversary) { color-scheme:light;--paper:#f8f2e9;--ink:#443b36;--ink-muted:#78675e;--accent:#a64e63;--accent-deep:#82364a;--accent-tint:#f0ded9;--rule:#ddcbbd;background:var(--paper);color:var(--ink); }
main { max-width:1060px;margin:auto;padding:0 clamp(1.25rem,5vw,4rem); }.dedication { display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:1rem;border-bottom:1px solid var(--rule);padding-block:1.8rem;font:.65rem var(--font-mono);letter-spacing:.08em;color:var(--ink-muted); }.dedication span:last-child { color:var(--accent);white-space:nowrap; }.opening { text-align:center;position:relative;padding-top:5rem; }.occasion { text-transform:uppercase;letter-spacing:.2em;font:.65rem var(--font-mono);color:var(--accent);margin-bottom:2rem; }h1 { font:400 clamp(3.2rem,7.7vw,6.2rem)/1.06 var(--font-display);letter-spacing:-.055em; }h1 em { font-weight:400;color:var(--accent); }.opening-note { margin-top:1.8rem;font-size:clamp(.9rem,1.7vw,1.05rem);line-height:1.9;color:var(--ink-muted); }.bouquet { max-width:600px;margin:1.5rem auto 0; }.flower { transform:rotate(calc(var(--turn) + var(--sway,0deg)));transition:transform .8s ease-out; }.blossom { transition:transform .5s; }.flower:hover .blossom { transform:scale(1.08); }.tiny-heart { display:block;font:2rem var(--font-display);color:var(--accent);margin-top:-1rem; }
.letter-section { max-width:620px;margin:4rem auto 0;scroll-margin-top:2rem; }.letter summary { cursor:pointer;list-style:none;text-align:center;padding:1rem; }.letter summary::-webkit-details-marker,.little-note summary::-webkit-details-marker { display:none; }.envelope-art { display:block;position:relative;width:220px;height:135px;margin:0 auto 1.5rem;background:#eddfd0;border:1px solid #c9ac98;box-shadow:0 12px 35px #71543c10;transform:rotate(-4deg);transition:transform .4s;overflow:hidden; }.envelope-art::before,.envelope-art::after { content:'';position:absolute;width:155px;height:155px;border:1px solid #c9ac98;transform:rotate(45deg);top:58px;background:#f1e5d7; }.envelope-art::before { left:-80px; }.envelope-art::after { right:-80px; }.envelope-flap { position:absolute;width:160px;height:160px;transform:rotate(45deg);top:-105px;left:29px;border:1px solid #c9ac98;background:#f3e8db; }.seal { display:grid;place-items:center;width:38px;height:38px;position:absolute;top:44px;left:90px;border-radius:50%;background:#a95063;color:#f8e8e0;z-index:1;font-size:1.4rem;box-shadow:inset 0 0 0 3px #ffffff15; }.letter summary:hover .envelope-art,.letter summary:focus-visible .envelope-art { transform:rotate(0deg) translateY(-4px); }.letter[open] .envelope-art { transform:rotate(3deg); }.letter-label { font:.7rem var(--font-mono);color:var(--accent); }.letter-label>span { display:inline-block;margin-left:.5rem; }.letter-paper { background:#fffaf3;margin-top:2rem;padding:clamp(1.5rem,5vw,3.5rem);border:1px solid var(--rule);box-shadow:0 15px 45px #67482e08;position:relative; }.letter-paper::before { content:'';position:absolute;inset:.6rem;border:1px solid #e8d9cc;pointer-events:none; }.letter-paper p { font-size:1rem;line-height:1.95;margin-top:1.4rem; }.letter-paper .salutation { font:italic 1.9rem var(--font-display);color:var(--accent);margin-top:0; }.letter-paper .postscript { font-size:.9rem;color:var(--accent); }.signature { position:relative; }.signature>span:not(.signature-heart) { font:italic 2.5rem var(--font-display);color:var(--accent); }.signature-heart { float:right;font-size:2rem;color:var(--accent); }
.keepsakes { padding-top:5rem; }.section-kicker { display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;gap:1.5rem; }.section-kicker>span { height:1px;max-width:80px;flex:1;background:var(--rule); }.section-kicker p { font:.65rem var(--font-mono);color:var(--ink-muted);text-align:center; }.notes { display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:1.2rem;margin-top:2rem;align-items:start; }.little-note { background:#f2e6db;border:1px solid var(--rule);padding:1.5rem;transform:rotate(-2deg);transition:transform .3s; }.little-note:first-child { grid-column:1 / -1; }.little-note:nth-child(2) { transform:rotate(2deg);background:#f1e2dd; }.little-note:nth-child(3) { transform:rotate(-1deg);background:#e9e9db; }.little-note:hover,.little-note:focus-within { transform:rotate(0); }.little-note summary { display:flex;align-items:center;gap:.8rem;cursor:pointer;list-style:none;font:1.2rem var(--font-display);line-height:1.3;min-height:44px; }.little-note summary>span { color:var(--accent);font-size:1.8rem; }.little-note p { margin-top:1rem;font-size:.85rem;line-height:1.9;color:var(--ink-muted); }footer { padding:5rem 0 3rem;text-align:center; }footer>p { font:400 clamp(1.7rem,4vw,2.5rem) var(--font-display); }footer>span { display:block;color:var(--ink-muted);font-size:.85rem;margin-top:.7rem; }footer>div { margin-top:3rem;font:.65rem var(--font-mono);letter-spacing:.2em; }footer i { font-style:normal;color:var(--accent);padding-inline:.5rem; }
@media(max-width:600px) { .opening { padding-top:3rem; }.occasion { margin-bottom:1.5rem; }.bouquet { margin-top:2rem; }.letter-section { margin-top:2.5rem; }.notes { grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:1rem;max-width:380px;margin-inline:auto; }.little-note { padding:1rem 1.5rem; }.keepsakes { padding-top:3.5rem; }.dedication { font-size:.58rem;padding-block:1.4rem; } }
@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce) { .flower { transform:rotate(var(--turn)) !important; }.flower:hover .blossom { transform:none; }.letter summary:hover .envelope-art,.letter summary:focus-visible .envelope-art,.little-note:hover,.little-note:focus-within { transform:none; } }
</style>
